1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.615 line:85% align:center
UPBEAT MUSIC

2
00:00:04.615 --> 00:00:07.500 line:85% align:center
<c.narrator>Real instruments are too hard.</c>

3
00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:10.962 line:85% align:center
<c.narrator>Most music toys are too simple.</c>

4
00:00:10.962 --> 00:00:14.904 line:85% align:center
<c.narrator>But from three to six,
children are ready for music,</c>

5
00:00:14.904 --> 00:00:17.308 line:85% align:center
<c.narrator>if they can learn through play.</c>

6
00:00:17.308 --> 00:00:19.769 line:85% align:center
<c.narrator>Meet Melody Mate.</c>

7
00:00:20.769 --> 00:00:25.385 line:85% align:center
<c.narrator>Nine instrument tokens.
Nine different voices.</c>

8
00:00:25.385 --> 00:00:29.423 line:85% align:center
<c.narrator>Place a token,
and the toy plays its sound.</c>

9
00:00:29.423 --> 00:00:32.885 line:85% align:center
<c.narrator>Touch zones rise and fall
with the beat.</c>

10
00:00:32.885 --> 00:00:36.346 line:85% align:center
<c.narrator>A friendly AI sprite
guides every step.</c>

11
00:00:36.346 --> 00:00:39.808 line:85% align:center
<c.narrator>Create. Learn. Challenge.</c>

12
00:00:39.808 --> 00:00:43.846 line:85% align:center
<c.narrator>Shaped by twelve interviews
and hands-on user testing.</c>

13
00:00:43.846 --> 00:00:47.445 line:85% align:center
<c.narrator>Melody Mate.
Music you can touch.</c>

